  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save the lives of 100 Hepatitis C patients</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hepatitis C is one of the biggest causes of mortality in Pakistan which has the second highest burden of this disease in the world. Untreated Hepatitis C can lead to liver cirrhosis which can then lead to liver cancer.  Our program includes blood testing, PCR confirmation test (which is done twice/treatment), medicinal treatment with regular followups upto 24 weeks to save the lives of Hep C patients .We also provide counselling and awareness to the local community and patient family members.</narrative>
  </description>
